WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:02.135
I mean, this is one heck of a fish tale.

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:03.903
A 12 year old boy out

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.739
fishing with his mom in Florida, hoping

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:07.874
maybe is going to catch a little tuna,

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:08.908
caught a whole lot more.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.177
Talk about a surprise this week.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:12.112
He reeled in.

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:13.046
Watch this.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:15.482
A great white shark.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.817
It took about 45 minutes for Campbell

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.486
Keenan to reel it in Campbell.

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:21.521
And his mom, Colleen, are with us now.

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:22.622
I mean,

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.090
this is probably the last thing,

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.992
Campbell, that you're expecting.

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:28.028
How are your arms feeling?

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.630
I'm they're hurting right now,

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.465
especially my forearms.

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:32.966
I'm sure.

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:36.836
When did you realize what was happening?

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:39.039
About 45 minutes

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:40.940
when we realized there was a shark

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.009
right when it hit the rock.

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:44.010
Right when I hit the rod,

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.111
it just took off.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:47.280
So were you scared at

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.282
all when you realized it was a shark?

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:49.983
Come on.

00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:51.885
I was definitely scared.

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:52.052
Yeah.

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:53.019
I was wondering

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:54.888
if I really want to fight a shark.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.156
Yeah, I think, you know, what?

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:57.424
I think that's a fair question

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:58.458
to have running through your mind,

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:00.560
Colleen, is you're watching this.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.728
You're like, wow, this is great.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.029
Cable's catching something.

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:05.031
Hold on. It's a shark.

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:07.700
I mean, that must have been something.

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:11.871
Yeah, well, right from the beginning,

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:12.539
it was scary

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:14.908
because it was obviously something big

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:16.176
because it was

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:18.278
it was pulling Campbell out of the seat.

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:21.448
So Campbell was attached to the rod,

00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:23.083
but he wasn't attached to the seat.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:23.950
So my friend

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:25.585
Katie and I had to hold Campbell

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:26.419
and make sure he didn't

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:27.787
fly out of the boat.

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:29.422
But then once we realized it was a shark,

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:29.956
it was just.

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:32.125
I mean, that was unbelievable and scary.

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:33.760
Yeah, a little scary.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.228
And as I understand, it,

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:37.363
when you're

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:37.797
on this

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:39.299
boat, like you're going out there,

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.401
you're hoping to catch a little tuna.

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:42.602
What did the boat

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:44.537
captain say where they surprised at all

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:46.739
that your son got a great white shark

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:49.609
Yeah.

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:51.377
I mean, it was very chaotic.

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:52.712
If you listen to the videos,

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.247
the first mate was just

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:55.682
he was kind of beside himself.

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:57.183
It was his first great white.

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:58.318
And I believe the captain

00:01:58.318 --> 00:02:00.920
probably had his problem before.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.323
So lots of lots of yelling

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:04.090
and chaos

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:06.159
and making sure no one got hurt.

00:02:06.593 --> 00:02:07.260
Yeah. So.

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:07.694
So, Campbell,

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:09.429
I know you said as it got closer,

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:11.564
then then the sharks swam away.

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:13.399
I mean, when did you

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:15.201
when did it really hit you

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:17.270
that you had caught a great white

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:18.872
little guy?

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.242
I mean, it really still hasn't.

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:24.444
But when right

00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:26.513
when I got to see the belly of it

00:02:26.513 --> 00:02:28.481
because it came up in a

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:30.450
and like catatonic state,

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:31.584
because it was in it,

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:34.521
it was on its belly, the back.

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:37.323
And we saw the White part.

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:37.824
And it

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:39.292
and the captain is like

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:41.661
that is a great white shark.

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:43.363
Do you think the shark was as surprised

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:45.532
as you were? Campbell,

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:49.302
I truly

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:50.503
I think they gave each other

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:51.804
a really good workout

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:54.107
because she was pretty exhausted.

00:02:54.107 --> 00:02:54.707
I can't

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:55.308
I just I'm

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:56.442
still trying to wrap my head around it

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:57.510
after watching the videos.

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:58.711
It's just really incredible.

00:02:58.711 --> 00:02:58.945
I mean,

00:02:58.945 --> 00:02:59.579
what does this mean

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:02.215
for your fishing career, Campbell?

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:04.450
Um,

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:08.054
it's definitely going to inspire me

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:09.455
to do better,

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:12.158
to get better at fishing and like,

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:13.693
try to

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.328
catch as many fish as I can

00:03:15.328 --> 00:03:17.497
and as many big fish as I can.

00:03:17.764 --> 00:03:19.232
I mean, this is a pretty darn big fish.

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:20.934
It's going to be a tough one to follow.

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:22.068
Before I let you go, I'm just curious

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:22.569
have you ever seen the

00:03:22.569 --> 00:03:23.503
movie Jaws Campbell

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:26.472
No.

00:03:26.472 --> 00:03:27.373
You know.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.541
Yeah. You know what?

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:30.810
I think I'm going to call her.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:31.611
Yeah.

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:35.248
Your mom is very sick.

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:36.950
The shark was safely released,

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:38.551
and so that was really fun

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:40.119
to get to watch her swim away.

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:41.654
And she was tagged, and Campbell

00:03:41.654 --> 00:03:43.356
got to name her grade.

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:46.359
Oh, so what's your name?

00:03:47.293 --> 00:03:48.561
Jan. Jan?

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:48.962
Jan?

00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:49.829
Jan, we're

00:03:49.829 --> 00:03:50.496
going to have to leave it there

00:03:50.496 --> 00:03:51.464
because we're out of time,

00:03:51.464 --> 00:03:52.632
but it is really great

00:03:52.632 --> 00:03:53.466
to have you guys here.

00:03:53.466 --> 00:03:54.400
What a story. You have.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.368
I know you've been getting calls

00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:57.403
from all over. Campbell calling.

00:03:57.403 --> 00:03:57.904
Thank you.

